nary `MessageListener` were counted as one message. Count logical deliveries within the Spring processing span so `messaging.client.consumed.messages` and `messaging.batch.message_count` reflect delivered fragments, including when a failure prevents delivery of the remaining batch.\n\n- **Accounting:** Count fragment dispatches rather than trusting producer count headers; retain single-message and list-batch behavior.\n- **Ownership:** Preserve producer correlation, error handling, context cleanup, and Spring/RabbitMQ processing ownership. Leave `consumerBatchEnabled` unchanged.\n- **Coverage:** Add installed-javaagent regressions for simple and direct containers across baseline/latest dependencies, including partial delivery failure and misleading count headers.","title":"Fix Spring Rabbit producer-batch message undercounting"},"mode":"publish","pr":20856,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1792730009,"generation":1,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"2879e4fe26414652b2f493157eef7e76","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":["Analyze (actions)","Analyze Java (none)","Analyze Kotlin (manual)","CodeQL","EasyCLA","build / build-servlet-images","build / common / build","build / common / check-gh-aw-lockfiles","build / common / examples","build / common / fossa-configuration-check","build / common / gradle-plugins-and-conventions","build / common / license-check","build / common / release-tooling-tests","build / common / repo-checks","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, jetty)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, liberty)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, other)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, payara)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, spring-aot)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, tomcat)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, tomee)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, websphere)","